### Complete Auth Endpoints Test Suite

### 1. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone_number": "+1234567890",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login to get tokens
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get current user info (replace YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4. Refresh access token (replace YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN with actual refresh token from login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}



### 5. Update password
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "current_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "newpassword456"
}

### 6. Send password reset email (generates new password and sends via email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

### 7. Login with new password (use the password received in email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "NEW_PASSWORD_FROM_EMAIL"
}

### 8. Logout (replace YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN with actual token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 9. Delete account (replace YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN with actual token)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "token": "YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN"
}

### Test Error Cases

### Invalid login credentials
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Invalid token for protected endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

### Expired or invalid refresh token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "invalid_refresh_token"
}

### Try to register with existing email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone_number": "+1234567891",
  "password": "password123"
}